From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruiyangke <me@ry.ke>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:04:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] a11y: Name controls and expose their states

Deferred: not part of the series. Apply on top of it to restore the
accessibility work from newport/compat-main.

- Dialog::aria_label and AlertDialog::aria_label name the modal host.
- Button::expanded exposes a disclosure state. Menu triggers expose Click,
  their expanded state and HasPopup::Menu, and a loading trigger does not
  open from the keyboard. Menu items mark their own node disabled.
- Combobox::accessibility_label, with the selected titles as its value,
  through new base Combobox setters.
- ListDelegate::item_accessibility_label names list rows; searchable lists
  use each item's title.
- Switch::accessibility_description and TabBar::accessibility_label.
- Pagination buttons, the editor search panel and notifications are named,
  and search reports its match count as a status.
